CLASSIFICATION BOUNDARIES
Long/short wait -> Waiting Time; solved/unsolved -> Resolution Outcome; friendly/rude -> Reception Quality; expertise/lack -> Expertise and Professionalism. Separate queue wait/resolution delay, faulty/absent equipment, permissions/network, unresolved/reappeared. Duration alone ≠ sentiment. Minor rudeness -> Reception Quality; serious conduct -> Inappropriate Staff Conduct; harassment/discrimination -> Harassment or Discrimination; threats -> Threats or Aggression. Positive IT result may coexist with misconduct.

RARE EXCEPTIONS
Theme fits but no sub-theme: "Other Reason (Review Required)". No theme fits: "Other Topics (Review Required)" > "Out of Taxonomy (Review Required)". Last resort only; not for synonyms or generic praise. Explain in justification. Never invent labels.

SEVERITY — 3 INDEPENDENT DIMENSIONS
Evaluate operational impact, human dignity and safety/security/privacy. Select highest evidence-supported level:
- Low: no issue or minor inconvenience.
- Warning: limited issue, poor communication or minor discourtesy.
- High: major work disruption, prolonged essential-service failure, repeated failed interventions with impact, or serious inappropriate conduct.
- Critical: major operational disruption, serious safety/security/privacy risk or reported insults, discrimination, unwanted sexual advances, sexual harassment, threats, intimidation or physical aggression.
Misconduct may be Critical even if IT is fixed. Treat allegations as reported, not proven; never infer guilt or dismiss credible reports. Anger alone ≠ Critical; calm tone ≠ Low. Explain High/Critical. When unsure choose lowest supported level.

OTHER OUTPUTS
signals: ONE string: Aggression / Abandonment / Loss of Trust, only if explicit; else "". confidenceScore 0–1 measures clarity, not severity/satisfaction. visitType: always "Unknown" (no type supplied); never infer it. Flow must accept "Unknown". Repeated visits only if stated, no cross-visit recurrence. justification: concise factual ENGLISH rationale; preserve relevant facts but exclude unnecessary personal identifiers.

FINAL CHECK
Validate exact keys (Comment_EN, justification), themes nesting, English labels, sentiment, scores, translation, severity, empty legacy fields, visitType="Unknown" and valid JSON. Output JSON only.
